  -- A bit set is required her for Arria 10.
  -- When a uint16 value is converted to uint32 and then casted to single it results in a denormal floating point number. 
  -- Some Altera Floating Point IPs convert denormal numbers into 0s. We avoid that by ensuring that the exponent is 
  -- non-zero
  -- Bias selection for 
  -- Conv & DSC
  -- For DSC, As num of IP & 
  -- OP layers are always 1,
  -- no need of last input feature
  -- signal for bias selection
  -- Switch selects between partial sum for Conv/DSC and Pooling layers output
  -- Switch selects bias for Conv & DSC layers , 
  -- Zeros for Pooling layers
  -- Switch selects between Weights 
  -- and pooling layer coefficients
  -- Int32 Bias implementation 
  -- This is tricky. 
  -- Maybe we need to 
  -- make state machine 
  -- delay explicit to avoid 
  -- this delay 
  -- ResultMem
  -- coefOffchipMem
  -- ResultMem
  -- Clipped and Leaky Relu's ReLUValue computation
  -- Conv + Clipped Relu
  -- DSC + clipped relu  
  -- Ceiling value is scaled to vector of
  -- i/p + weight exponents in DSC+Clip Relu mode 
  -- DSC + Leaky Relu, Relu
  -- Delays added to fix timing violations.
  -- A delay of +1 was added during dilation support to resolve timing issues in streaming controller.
  -- This part needed only one delay to resolve timing issues in streaming controller.
  -- A delay added to balance the delayed start in streaming controller. 
  -- The start is delayed by a clock inside the compute function of streaming controller for the regular convolution 
  -- and all other modules except unpool(which uses another MLFB called computeUnpool
  -- This is done to fix timing issus for dilation support.
  -- Due to delayed start, the inputs to streaming controller other than LC parameters are also delayed by a cycle to 
  -- balance
  -- When dilation > 1, no adjustment to zAddr is required by addition
  -- because streaming controller itself populates the right addresses for all tiles i.e., blocks of 3x3 data read from 
  -- input image for different blocks of 3x3 weights that are broken down
  -- Delay balancing is less by 1 cycle here. Since the start is delayed inside the streaming controller, the outputs 
  -- are automatically delayed by 1 cycle.
  -- Hence, the rest of the signals other than streaming controller oputputs are only delayed.

